   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Se sabe que la gráfica de la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+c\\) es la que aparece en el dibujo.<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='50.0,150.0 51.9,141.8 53.8,134.0 55.6,126.6 57.5,119.5 59.4,112.9 61.3,106.7 63.1,100.8 65.0,95.3 66.9,90.2 68.8,85.4 70.6,81.0 72.5,76.8 74.4,73.1 76.2,69.6 78.1,66.4 80.0,63.6 81.9,61.0 83.8,58.8 85.6,56.8 87.5,55.1 89.4,53.6 91.2,52.4 93.1,51.5 95.0,50.8 96.9,50.3 98.8,50.0 100.6,50.0 102.5,50.2 104.4,50.6 106.2,51.1 108.1,51.9 110.0,52.8 111.9,53.9 113.8,55.2 115.6,56.6 117.5,58.1 119.4,59.8 121.3,61.6 123.1,63.6 125.0,65.6 126.9,67.8 128.8,70.0 130.6,72.4 132.5,74.8 134.4,77.3 136.2,79.9 138.1,82.5 140.0,85.2 141.9,87.9 143.8,90.7 145.6,93.5 147.5,96.3 149.4,99.1 151.2,101.9 153.1,104.7 155.0,107.5 156.9,110.2 158.8,113.0 160.6,115.7 162.5,118.4 164.4,121.0 166.2,123.5 168.1,126.0 170.0,128.4 171.9,130.7 173.8,132.9 175.6,135.1 177.5,137.1 179.4,139.0 181.2,140.8 183.1,142.4 185.0,143.9 186.9,145.3 188.8,146.5 190.6,147.5 192.5,148.4 194.4,149.1 196.2,149.6 198.1,149.9 200.0,150.0 200.0,150.0 198.1,150.0 196.2,150.0 194.4,150.0 192.5,150.0 190.6,150.0 188.8,150.0 186.9,150.0 185.0,150.0 183.1,150.0 181.2,150.0 179.4,150.0 177.5,150.0 175.6,150.0 173.8,150.0 171.9,150.0 170.0,150.0 168.1,150.0 166.2,150.0 164.4,150.0 162.5,150.0 160.6,150.0 158.8,150.0 156.9,150.0 155.0,150.0 153.1,150.0 151.2,150.0 149.4,150.0 147.5,150.0 145.6,150.0 143.8,150.0 141.9,150.0 140.0,150.0 138.1,150.0 136.2,150.0 134.4,150.0 132.5,150.0 130.6,150.0 128.8,150.0 126.9,150.0 125.0,150.0 123.1,150.0 121.3,150.0 119.4,150.0 117.5,150.0 115.6,150.0 113.8,150.0 111.9,150.0 110.0,150.0 108.1,150.0 106.2,150.0 104.4,150.0 102.5,150.0 100.6,150.0 98.8,150.0 96.9,150.0 95.0,150.0 93.1,150.0 91.2,150.0 89.4,150.0 87.5,150.0 85.6,150.0 83.8,150.0 81.9,150.0 80.0,150.0 78.1,150.0 76.2,150.0 74.4,150.0 72.5,150.0 70.6,150.0 68.8,150.0 66.9,150.0 65.0,150.0 63.1,150.0 61.3,150.0 59.4,150.0 57.5,150.0 55.6,150.0 53.8,150.0 51.9,150.0 50.0,150.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='42.5,187.2 44.7,175.8 46.8,165.0 49.0,154.8 51.1,145.1 53.3,136.0 55.4,127.4 57.6,119.4 59.7,111.8 61.9,104.8 64.0,98.2 66.2,92.1 68.3,86.5 70.5,81.4 72.6,76.6 74.8,72.3 76.9,68.5 79.0,65.0 81.2,61.9 83.4,59.2 85.5,56.9 87.7,55.0 89.8,53.3 92.0,52.0 94.1,51.1 96.2,50.4 98.4,50.1 100.6,50.0 102.7,50.2 104.8,50.7 107.0,51.4 109.1,52.4 111.3,53.5 113.5,54.9 115.6,56.5 117.8,58.3 119.9,60.3 122.1,62.4 124.2,64.7 126.3,67.2 128.5,69.7 130.7,72.4 132.8,75.2 135.0,78.1 137.1,81.1 139.2,84.1 141.4,87.2 143.6,90.4 145.7,93.6 147.8,96.8 150.0,100.0 152.1,103.2 154.3,106.4 156.4,109.6 158.6,112.8 160.8,115.9 162.9,118.9 165.1,121.9 167.2,124.8 169.3,127.6 171.5,130.3 173.7,132.8 175.8,135.3 177.9,137.6 180.1,139.7 182.2,141.7 184.4,143.5 186.5,145.1 188.7,146.5 190.9,147.6 193.0,148.6 195.2,149.3 197.3,149.8 199.4,150.0 201.6,149.9 203.8,149.6 205.9,148.9 208.0,148.0 210.2,146.7 212.3,145.0 214.5,143.1 216.7,140.8 218.8,138.1 220.9,135.0 223.1,131.5 225.3,127.7 227.4,123.4 229.5,118.6 231.7,113.5 233.8,107.9 236.0,101.8 238.2,95.2 240.3,88.2 242.4,80.6 244.6,72.6 246.8,64.0 248.9,54.9 251.0,45.2 253.2,35.0 255.3,24.2 257.5,12.8' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-width='2'/><text x='210.0' y='27.5' fill='#334155' font-size='10'>y = f(x)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 150.0H294.0M150.0 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='50.0' y1='147.0' x2='50.0' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='47.0' y='164.0' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='100.0' y1='147.0' x2='100.0' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='97.0' y='164.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='200.0' y1='147.0' x2='200.0' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='197.0' y='164.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='250.0' y1='147.0' x2='250.0' y2='153.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='247.0' y='164.0' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div>",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Determina \\(f\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula el área de la región sombreada."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En el dibujo la gráfica corta al eje en \\(x=-2\\) y es tangente a él en \\(x=1\\) (mínimo con valor 0). Así \\(f(-2)=0\\), \\(f(1)=0\\) y \\(f'(1)=0\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}-8+4a-2b+c=0\\\\1+a+b+c=0\\\\3+2a+b=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Restando las dos primeras: \\(9-3a+3b=0\\iff b=a-3\\). En la 3.ª: \\(3+2a+a-3=0\\iff a=0\\), \\(b=-3\\), y \\(c=-1-a-b=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(f(x)=x^3-3x+2\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Factorizada: \\(f(x)=(x+2)(x-1)^2\\): raíz simple en \\(-2\\) y doble en \\(1\\), como en el dibujo ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La región sombreada está entre la gráfica y el eje, de \\(x=-2\\) a \\(x=1\\), con \\(f\\geq0\\):</p>\\[A=\\int_{-2}^1(x^3-3x+2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^4}4-\\frac{3x^2}2+2x\\Bigr]_{-2}^1=\\frac34-(-6)=\\frac{27}4\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{27}4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "mono",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "area",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_5.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-5-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida para \\(x\\neq2\\) por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2-4x+3}{x-2}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula, si existen, el máximo y el mínimo absolutos de \\(f\\) en el intervalo \\([0,2)\\) (puntos en los que se obtienen y valores que alcanza la función)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Dividiendo, \\(x^2-4x+3=(x-2)^2-1\\), así que \\(f(x)=x-2-\\dfrac1{x-2}\\).</p><p><b>Vertical:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to2}f(x)=\\frac{-1}0=\\infty\\): \\(x=2\\). <b>Horizontal:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}f(x)=\\pm\\infty\\): no hay. <b>Oblicua:</b> \\(f(x)-(x-2)=-\\frac1{x-2}\\to0\\): \\(y=x-2\\).</p><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=2\\) y asíntota oblicua \\(y=x-2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=1+\\frac1{(x-2)^2}\\gt0\\ \\text{ para todo }x\\neq2\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 192 108' width='100%' style='max-width:230px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H178' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><circle cx='96' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M43.0 40L79.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 11L79.0 10L77.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &gt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(f\\) es creciente en \\((-\\infty,2)\\) y en \\((2,+\\infty)\\); nunca decrece</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En \\([0,2)\\) \\(f\\) es creciente: el mínimo absoluto está en el extremo izquierdo, \\(f(0)=\\frac3{-2}=-\\frac32\\). Por la derecha, \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to2^-}f(x)=+\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(-\\frac1{x-2}\\): el denominador tiende a \\(0^-\\), así que el cociente tiende a \\(+\\infty\\).</i>: no hay máximo.</p><div class='res'>Mínimo absoluto en \\(\\left(0,-\\frac32\\right)\\); no tiene máximo absoluto en \\([0,2)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "asint",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "mono",
     "apartados": "b, c"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_5.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-5-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Álvaro, Marta y Guillermo son tres hermanos. Álvaro dice a Marta: si te doy la quinta parte del dinero que tengo, los tres hermanos tendremos la misma cantidad. Calcula lo que tiene cada uno si entre los tres juntan 84 euros.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Sean \\(a\\), \\(m\\) y \\(g\\) los euros de Álvaro, Marta y Guillermo. Si Álvaro da \\(\\frac a5\\) a Marta, los tres tienen lo mismo:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}a+m+g=84\\\\a-\\frac a5=m+\\frac a5\\\\a-\\frac a5=g\\end{cases}\\]<p>Al final cada uno tiene la tercera parte del total (el dinero solo cambia de manos): \\(\\frac{84}3=28\\). Entonces \\(\\frac{4a}5=28\\iff a=35\\); \\(m=28-\\frac{35}5=21\\); \\(g=28\\).</p><div class='res'>Álvaro 35 €, Marta 21 € y Guillermo 28 €</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(35+21+28=84\\), y tras dar 7 € Álvaro: \\(28,\\ 28,\\ 28\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "plan",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2005-RESERVA_5.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2005-reserva-5-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el punto \\(A(0,-3,1)\\), el plano \\(\\pi\\equiv2x-2y+3z=0\\) y la recta \\(r\\equiv x+3=y=\\dfrac{z-3}2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano que pasa por \\(A\\) y contiene a \\(r\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Determina la ecuación de la recta que pasa por \\(A\\), es paralela a \\(\\pi\\) y corta a \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(-3,0,3)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(1,1,2)\\): \\(r\\equiv(-3+t,\\,t,\\,3+2t)\\).</p><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RA}=(3,-3,-2)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RA}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&1&2\\\\3&-3&-2\\end{vmatrix}=(4,\\,8,\\,-6)\\parallel(2,4,-3)\\]<p>Plano \\(2x+4y-3z+D=0\\) por \\(A\\): \\(0-12-3+D=0\\iff D=15\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(2x+4y-3z+15=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta está en el plano \\(\\pi'\\) paralelo a \\(\\pi\\) que pasa por \\(A\\): \\(2x-2y+3z+D=0\\), con \\(0+6+3+D=0\\iff D=-9\\). Corta a \\(r\\) donde \\(r\\) corta a \\(\\pi'\\):</p>\\[2(-3+t)-2t+3(3+2t)-9=0\\iff6t-6=0\\iff t=1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ Q(-2,1,5)\\]\\[\\overrightarrow{AQ}=(-2,4,4)\\parallel(-1,2,2)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-114,\"el\":32,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-3.8,-0.8,1.4],[-1.2,1.8,6.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-1.2,1.8,6.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0.4,-3.8,0.2],[-2.4,1.8,5.8],\"#e11d48\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-2.4,1.8,5.8],\"s\",\"#e11d48\",6,0],[\"pt\",[0,-3,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-2,1,5],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m05r5a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m05r5a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m05r5a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m05r5a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='200.2' x2='64.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='70.5' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='173.9' y1='246.0' x2='32.5' y2='45.4' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='38.5' y='45.4' fill='#e11d48' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='153.7' cy='217.3' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='160.7' y='211.3' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='52.7' cy='74.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='59.7' y='68.1' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.6' y2='266.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='40.7' y='269.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='17.5' y2='262.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='12.2' y='263.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='256.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='255.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=-\\lambda\\\\y=-3+2\\lambda\\\\z=1+2\\lambda\\end{cases}\\), \\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\((-1,2,2)\\cdot(2,-2,3)=-2-4+6=0\\): paralela a \\(\\pi\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
